      <VERS vnumber="1"> To the chief <gr str="5329">Musician</gr>, <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> even </STYLE> to <gr str="3038">Jeduthun</gr>, A <gr str="4210">Psalm </gr>of <gr str="1732">David</gr>. I <gr str="559">said</gr>, I will take <gr str="8104">heed </gr>to my <gr str="1870">ways</gr>, that I sin <gr str="4480 2398">not </gr>with my <gr str="3956">tongue</gr>: I will <gr str="8104">keep </gr>my <gr str="6310">mouth </gr>with a <gr str="4269">bridle</gr>, <gr str="5750">while </gr>the <gr str="7563">wicked </gr>is <gr str="5048">before </gr>me. </VERS>
